{%- comment -%}
  THE TEAM STORE BUILDER.

  This is the markup and the JavaScript of the Build Your Team Store
  page, lifted verbatim out of the Shopify PAGE BODY and into the theme.
  Its stylesheet is assets/trh-builder.css.

  WHY IT MOVED. The builder was 112KB living in one page's body_html
  field. A page body is GLOBAL, it belongs to the shop and not to any
  theme, the same way a menu does, so there was no way to change the
  builder without changing the live site at the same instant, and no way
  to preview a change at all. It also sat one accidental Rich Text save
  away from being destroyed, with no copy anywhere.

  As a theme file it is per theme, so it can be previewed on a draft
  theme, published when it is right, and rolled back by republishing.

  EVERYTHING BELOW IS WRAPPED IN raw. The builder's JavaScript contains
  no Liquid today, verified 2026-11-03: zero occurrences of the two
  opening delimiters. The closing sequences DO appear, 10 of one and 76
  of the other, but they are CSS and JS braces and Liquid only reacts to
  the openers. raw is here so that a future edit introducing one cannot
  silently turn part of the app into a Liquid tag.

  So nothing in here can read a theme setting. If the catalog URL or the
  upload variant should become editable, lift those two constants out
  above the raw block and pass them in on a data attribute.
{%- endcomment -%}

