  <div class="faqgrid">
<details><summary>How do I use the builder?</summary><p>1. Fill in your team name, your name, email and main team color, and upload your logo if you have it. 2. On the next screen, tap a color on any product to add it in that color (tap again to remove it). The fastest start is the recommended store button at the top. 3. Tap Review &amp; send. Nothing is charged and nothing goes live: we email you a free preview first. <a href="#" class="faqv">Watch the 1-minute video</a>.</p></details><details><summary>How do I start a team store?</summary><p>Use this builder: upload your logo, pick your products and colors, and send us your request. We'll set up the store and email you a preview before it goes live.</p></details><details><summary>What does it cost to set up?</summary><p>Nothing. Setting up a team store is free, and your team members buy directly from the store.</p></details><details><summary>Is there a minimum order?</summary><p>No minimums at all. Members can order one item or fifty.</p></details><details><summary>How long is the store open?</summary><p>Once your store launches, it stays open, so members can order any time, all season and beyond.</p></details><details><summary>What logo files should I send?</summary><p>A PNG with a transparent background works best. JPG, SVG, PDF and AI files are fine too. If you have a white or one-color version, add it as your second logo and we'll use whichever shows up best on each color. No logo yet? We can help.</p></details><details><summary>Where does the logo go?</summary><p>Tees, hoodies and crews: full chest or left chest. Zip and button-front styles (quarter zips, jackets, polos): always left chest. Pants and shorts: left leg. Hats and bags: front.</p></details><details><summary>Can we add a second logo?</summary><p>Yes. Tops can add a logo on the back, back neck or sleeve for $3 per item.</p></details><details><summary>How is pricing set?</summary><p>Prices include one logo. Each additional logo location adds $3.</p></details><details><summary>Can our store raise money for the team?</summary><p>Yes. Choose 5–25% on the last step (Review &amp; send) and it's built into each item's price. We send fundraising checks periodically, on a schedule we agree on with you.</p></details><details><summary>Will we see the store before it goes live?</summary><p>Yes. We send a preview with mockups for your approval first.</p></details>
</div>
</section>
